  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43340770",
      "title": "Creating a Server Action",
      "lectureOrder": 168,
      "videoOrder": 156,
      "sourceHash": "321eeea4213cca645e72fbaaced31e831958f8242fc2288d94514d388d03202a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.69,
          "end": 3.12,
          "en": "So how do we convert this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.12,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "this form action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 7.153,
          "en": "this client form action into a server action?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.153,
          "end": 8.94,
          "en": "Well, it's simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.94,
          "end": 12.09,
          "en": "Inside of this function, and that's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.09,
          "end": 16.713,
          "en": "It must be inside of that function, you add use server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.18,
          "end": 21.3,
          "en": "Now you might recall the use client directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.3,
          "end": 24.93,
          "en": "which we had to use here and there earlier in the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.93,
          "end": 29.22,
          "en": "to mark a component as a client-side component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.22,
          "end": 33.09,
          "en": "So as a component that's also executing on the client,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.09,
          "end": 35.471,
          "en": "which all those other React components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.471,
          "end": 40.05,
          "en": "in a NextJS project normally don't do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.05,
          "end": 42.66,
          "en": "Now here we see use server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.66,
          "end": 45.903,
          "en": "and that's some code we didn't need thus far.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.77,
          "end": 51.143,
          "en": "use server is also a directive, just like use client,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.143,
          "end": 56.13,
          "en": "which you don't need to mark components as server components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.13,
          "end": 57.81,
          "en": "because that's the default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.81,
          "end": 61.86,
          "en": "but which you do need to create a server action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.86,
          "end": 64.059,
          "en": "So, which we do need here in this case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.059,
          "end": 68.58,
          "en": "to tell React and NextJS that this function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.58,
          "end": 71.55,
          "en": "this action which we set on this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.55,
          "end": 76.11,
          "en": "is not a client form action, but a so-called server action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.11,
          "end": 79.14,
          "en": "That's why use server is important here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.14,
          "end": 80.55,
          "en": "And that's not all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.55,
          "end": 84.53999999999999,
          "en": "If we would just add this, we would get another error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.53999999999999,
          "end": 86.58,
          "en": "As you see if I reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.58,
          "end": 89.25,
          "en": "We would get the error that Server actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.25,
          "end": 91.83,
          "en": "must be async functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.83,
          "end": 93.84,
          "en": "because that's indeed something else",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.84,
          "end": 96.18,
          "en": "you must do with that function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.18,
          "end": 99.55,
          "en": "You must add the async keyword in front of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.00999999999999,
          "end": 103.97999999999999,
          "en": "so that it will return a promise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.97999999999999,
          "end": 107.91,
          "en": "And that then converts this function into a server action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.91,
          "end": 110.37,
          "en": "which unlike that client form action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.37,
          "end": 113.34,
          "en": "will now only execute on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.34,
          "end": 116.49000000000001,
          "en": "So this code can't execute on the client,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.49000000000001,
          "end": 117.69,
          "en": "no matter what you do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.69,
          "end": 120.39,
          "en": "it will only execute on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.39,
          "end": 122.887,
          "en": "So in the end, what NextJS will do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.887,
          "end": 126.511,
          "en": "is it will make sure that once this form is submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.511,
          "end": 128.88,
          "en": "it will, behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.88,
          "end": 132.63,
          "en": "send a request to itself, you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.63,
          "end": 134.97,
          "en": "and trigger that function for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.97,
          "end": 136.749,
          "en": "And you don't need to send the request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.749,
          "end": 139.92000000000002,
          "en": "and attach any form data manually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.92000000000002,
          "end": 142.53,
          "en": "Instead, NextJS will take care of that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.53,
          "end": 144.6,
          "en": "and you can just add your logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.6,
          "end": 146.07999999999998,
          "en": "for handling the form submission",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.07999999999998,
          "end": 148.623,
          "en": "into this server action function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.73,
          "end": 152.16,
          "en": "And in this case, I'm just extracting some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.16,
          "end": 153.993,
          "en": "and logging it to the console.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.98,
          "end": 158.125,
          "en": "But with all that done, now, finally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.125,
          "end": 160.98,
          "en": "if we reload, we get no more error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.98,
          "end": 164.403,
          "en": "and we should be able to enter some data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.48,
          "end": 169.32,
          "en": "A delicious burger image here, doesn't matter though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.32,
          "end": 173.55,
          "en": "because we won't store it anywhere at this point anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.55,
          "end": 175.65,
          "en": "And if I now click Create Post,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.65,
          "end": 177.72,
          "en": "we won't get any feedback here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.72,
          "end": 180.03,
          "en": "because we haven't added any logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.03,
          "end": 182.28,
          "en": "at all to provide feedback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.28,
          "end": 186.06,
          "en": "But if you go back and open that terminal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 186.06,
          "end": 188.812,
          "en": "where you started that development server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 188.812,
          "end": 191.793,
          "en": "you should see some output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.41,
          "end": 197.76,
          "en": "You see three values here, two times the text test,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.76,
          "end": 198.81,
          "en": "and then the file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.81,
          "end": 202.11,
          "en": "which I uploaded with the data that describes it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.11,
          "end": 205.74,
          "en": "And these three pieces of data, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 205.74,
          "end": 209.85,
          "en": "are these three variables which we fill with data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.85,
          "end": 211.44,
          "en": "that we extract from the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.44,
          "end": 213.39,
          "en": "And that therefore proves",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.39,
          "end": 216.6,
          "en": "that this server action is executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.6,
          "end": 218.97,
          "en": "and that it is executed on the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.97,
          "end": 222.57,
          "en": "because any log output we see here in this terminal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.57,
          "end": 224.511,
          "en": "where we started the development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.511,
          "end": 226.663,
          "en": "is a server-side log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.663,
          "end": 231.15,
          "en": "And we see that extracting that foreign data works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.15,
          "end": 235.14,
          "en": "And that's the offer, how we can create such a server action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.14,
          "end": 237.512,
          "en": "and how we can use such a server action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.512,
          "end": 240.39,
          "en": "to handle the submission of a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.39,
          "end": 243.303,
          "en": "and extract the data that was submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.53,
          "end": 248.4,
          "en": "Well, and with that, as a next step, I, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.4,
          "end": 252.24,
          "en": "want to make sure that we actually also store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 252.24,
          "end": 254.403,
          "en": "that data in the database.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
